            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">See what Jarvis is thinking.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.13</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The owl glows while Jarvis looks for tasks. Click it to see what he is reading right now.</li>
  <li>"See everything" shows each step in plain words: where he searched, what he read, what he thought, and the tasks he found.</li>
  <li>Settings now opens from the gear next to the date on Focus.</li>
  <li>The "Your context" history screen is gone. Your rules are still in Settings → Tasks.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
